        }
      </h2><div class="matrix-grid">
        <div class="surface matrix">
          <h3>Random Forest (E0)</h3><p>
            Threshold 0.5 · F1: 0.9950 · ROC-AUC: 0.9994
          </p><div class="table-wrap">
            <table class="data-table">
              <caption class="sr-only"
                >Random Forest Held-out Test confusion matrix</caption
              ><thead
                ><tr
                  ><th scope="col"
                    >{isVi ? "Thực tế \\ Dự đoán" : "Actual \\ Predicted"}</th
                  ><th scope="col">Benign (0)</th><th scope="col">Attack (1)</th
                  ></tr
                ></thead
              ><tbody
                ><tr
