                    >144,364 TP</td
                  ></tr
                ></tbody
              >
            </table>
          </div>
        </div><div class="surface matrix">
          <h3>Isolation Forest (E0)</h3><p>
            Threshold 0.031268 · F1: 0.5842 · ROC-AUC: 0.8330
          </p><div class="table-wrap">
            <table class="data-table">
              <caption class="sr-only"
                >Isolation Forest Held-out Test confusion matrix</caption
              ><thead
