                }</td
              ><td
                >AES-256-GCM 256B: 72,177.2 ops/s (P95 13.3 µs; 1KB P95 11.4 µs;
                4KB P95 38.4 µs); process_batch(32): 386.37 flow/s (&gt;23x vs
                16.75 flow/s)</td
              ><td>BENCHMARK VALIDATED</td></tr
            ></tbody
          >
        </table>
      </div><div class="risk-grid">
        <article>
          <span>01</span><h3>
