                : "Vectorized process_batch(32) achieves 386.37 flow/s (>23x over single-flow 16.75 flow/s) and Dataset Replay streams at 399.44 flow/s, while AES-256-GCM encryption keeps P95 latency at 11.4–38.4 µs across 256B–4KB payloads."
            }
          </p>
        </article>
      </div><div class="callout">
        <strong>
